sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student
    participant UI as React UI<br/>(Exam Page)
    participant JOB as Auto-Submit Job<br/>(server scheduler)
    participant API as API Layer<br/>(Express)
    participant EX as Exam Management<br/>Service
    participant EV as Evaluation<br/>Engine
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant NOTIF as Notification<br/>Service
    participant AUD as Audit & Logging<br/>Service

    alt Manual submit (FR-OE-019)
        S->>UI: Click "Submit"
        UI->>UI: Count unanswered questions from local state
        UI->>S: Confirmation dialog "You have N unanswered questions. Submit?"
        S->>UI: Confirm
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/attempts/{attemptId}/submit {mode: "MANUAL", answers[]}
    else Timer reaches zero in browser (FR-OE-020)
        UI->>UI: Countdown = 0, lock inputs
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/attempts/{attemptId}/submit {mode: "AUTO", answers[]}
    else Browser closed / offline at expiry (FR-OE-020, NFR-OE-005)
        JOB->>DB: every 10 s: find attempts {status: IN_PROGRESS, endsAt + 5 s < serverNow}
        DB-->>JOB: expired attempts
        JOB->>EX: finalizeAttempt(attemptId, mode = "AUTO_SERVER") using last saved answers
    end

    API->>API: authenticate + authorize(Student) + CSRF check
    API->>EX: submitAttempt(attemptId, studentId, mode, answers)
    EX->>EX: Verify owner = studentId (SEC-OE-009)
    alt Already SUBMITTED (duplicate / retry)
        EX-->>API: existing submission summary (idempotent)
        API-->>UI: 200 OK {status: SUBMITTED}
    else serverNow > endsAt + 5 s grace
        EX->>EX: Discard late payload, keep last auto-saved answers
    else Within time
        EX->>DB: bulkWrite final answers
    end
    EX->>DB: findOneAndUpdate {_id, status: IN_PROGRESS} -> {status: SUBMITTED, submittedAt, mode}<br/>(atomic: prevents double submission)
    EX->>AUD: log ATTEMPT_SUBMITTED {attemptId, studentId, mode}

    EX->>EV: evaluate(attemptId) (FR-OE-022)
    EV->>DB: load answers + questions (correctOption, marks) + exam.negativeMark
    DB-->>EV: data
    EV->>EV: score = sum(marks of correct) - negativeMark x wrongCount (min 0)<br/>passed = score >= passMark
    EV->>DB: update attempt {score, passed, evaluatedAt} (target <= 5 s, NFR-OE-003)
    EV-->>EX: result
    EX-)NOTIF: resultAvailable(studentId, examId) (async, FR-OE-026)
    NOTIF->>DB: insert in-app notification
    NOTIF-)NOTIF: send email via SMTP
    EX-->>API: {status: SUBMITTED, submittedAt, score, maxScore, passed, reviewAvailableAt = exam.endAt}
    API-->>UI: 200 OK
    UI->>S: "Exam submitted" screen with score + pass/fail (FR-OE-023)
    Note over UI,EX: Question-wise review with correct answers (API-16) unlocks only after exam.endAt<br/>and only if enabled by the Instructor (SEC-OE-007)
